------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party data attribution
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Every dossier in this resource is anchored to a MIBiG (Minimum Information
about a Biosynthetic Gene cluster) accession (https://mibig.secondarymetabolites.org).
Primary experimental evidence is drawn from the cited literature; see
data/processed/source.csv, supplementary/supp_table10_source_bibliography.csv
and the manuscript references for the individual source records and DOIs.
Please cite the relevant MIBiG accessions and primary literature, in addition
to this resource, when reusing the integrated data.
